# PureSOC — Full Product Implementation Prompt

## Context
PureSOC is a Docker-first, multitenant EU NIS2 compliance and remediation platform.
Stack: Node.js API, Prisma/PostgreSQL, lightweight node:http web server, BullMQ workers,
Microsoft 365 Graph connector, Stripe billing. All containers defined in docker-compose.
The codebase is at /mnt/solodata/SoloCode/pure_soc.

Implement all items below in order. Each section is a self-contained milestone. Commit
after each milestone with a descriptive message. Do not skip sections or combine them.
Read existing code before writing new code — patterns are already established.

