## MILESTONE 2 — Notification & Alert System

### Goal
Alert users by email (and optionally Slack/Teams webhook) for time-critical events.

### What to do
1. Add a `notifications` schema section in Prisma:
   - NotificationChannel { id, org_id, type: email|slack_webhook|teams_webhook, destination,
     enabled, created_at }
   - NotificationLog { id, org_id, channel_id, event_type, payload_hash, sent_at, status,
     error_message }

2. Create a NotificationService with send(orgId, event, payload) method.
   - Dispatches to all enabled channels for that org
   - Logs every send attempt in NotificationLog
   - Never throws — failures are logged, not propagated

3. Define notification event types and their triggers:
   - CRITICAL_GAP_DETECTED → trigger when ComplianceGap with severity=critical is created/updated
   - M365_DRIFT_DETECTED → trigger when a ProviderFinding status changes open→new after a sync
   - INCIDENT_DEADLINE_APPROACHING → trigger 6h before each incident reporting deadline
   - EVIDENCE_EXPIRING → trigger 7 days before EvidenceArtifact expiry date
   - CHECKLIST_OVERDUE → trigger when ChecklistRun passes due date without completion
   - REMEDIATION_ACTION_COMPLETED → trigger when ProviderActionRun reaches verified state

4. Add a scheduler job (runs every 30 min) that queries for upcoming deadlines and queues
   INCIDENT_DEADLINE_APPROACHING and EVIDENCE_EXPIRING notifications.

5. Add API endpoints:
   - GET  /organizations/:orgId/notification-channels
   - POST /organizations/:orgId/notification-channels  (create email or webhook channel)
   - DELETE /organizations/:orgId/notification-channels/:id
   - POST /organizations/:orgId/notification-channels/:id/test  (send test notification)
   - GET  /organizations/:orgId/notification-logs

6. Add UI settings panel under Settings → Notifications with channel list, add/remove,
   and a "Send test" button per channel.

### Email template content (plain text + HTML)
- Subject prefix: [PureSOC]
- CRITICAL_GAP_DETECTED: "New critical NIS2 gap detected in {controlName}. Login to review."
- INCIDENT_DEADLINE_APPROACHING: "Action required: {deadlineType} deadline in 6 hours."
- EVIDENCE_EXPIRING: "{count} evidence artifact(s) expire in 7 days."
- CHECKLIST_OVERDUE: "Checklist '{name}' is overdue. Assigned to {assignee}."

### Acceptance criteria
- Creating an email channel and triggering a test sends a real email via configured SMTP
- Creating a Slack webhook channel and triggering a test posts to Slack
- CRITICAL_GAP_DETECTED fires when a new critical gap is persisted
- INCIDENT_DEADLINE_APPROACHING fires via scheduler within 30 min of the 6h window
- All sends are logged in NotificationLog regardless of success/failure

